sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant G as Trusted Gateway PEP
  participant P as PDP
  participant V as Trusted Registry
  participant D as Cloud DB
  participant B as Broker PEP
  participant K as KMS
  participant L as Audit
  User->>G: F1 authenticated read request
  G->>V: Resolve authoritative tenant/object/current version
  V-->>G: Expected context + current manifest
  G->>P: F2 verified attributes + requested fields + action
  P-->>G: Permit or deny + policy version
  alt Denied or dependency unavailable
    G->>L: Deny/error metadata
    G-->>User: Safe rejection, no keys or plaintext
  else Permitted
    G->>D: F4 fetch encrypted fields
    D-->>G: Envelope + capsule
    G->>B: Bound decrypt request and expected context
    B->>P: Independent authorization + revocation check
    B->>V: Verify current capsule/version/hash
    B->>K: Unwrap with validated context
    K-->>B: Scoped DEK
    B-->>G: DEK over authenticated confidential channel
    G->>G: Check versions; AEAD verify before plaintext release
    G->>L: F9 decision/key-use/result metadata
    G-->>User: Authorized fields only
  end
